        "prior_work": "COMPASS (Chicago Multiethnic Prevention and Surveillance Study) is a longitudinal cohort study of cardiovascular health behaviors and outcomes in a multiethnic urban population.",
        "why_this_cohort": "COMPASS provides comprehensive data on maternal reproductive histories (including breastfeeding) and clinical diagnoses (including gout) across multiple survey modules. The cohort's geographic stratification by community area and multiethnic composition support investigation of social and metabolic determinants of gout risk."
